\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Great is our redeeming Lord,
\par In power, and truth, and grace;
\par Him, by highest heaven adored,
\par His Church on earth doth praise;
\par In the city of our God,
\par In His holy mount below,
\par Publish, spread His name abroad,
\par And all His greatness show.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. For Thy loving- kindness, Lord,
\par We in Thy temple stay,
\par Here Thy faithful love record,
\par Thy saving power display:
\par With Thy name Thy praise is known,
\par Glorious Thy perfections shine;
\par Earth's remotest bounds shall own
\par Thy works are all divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. See the Gospel Church secure,
\par And founded on a rock;
\par All her promises are sure;
\par Her bulwarks who can shock?
\par Count her every precious shrine,
\par Tell, to after- ages tell,
\par Fortified by power divine,
\par The Church can never fail.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Zion's God is all our own,
\par Who on His love rely;
\par We His pardoning love have known,
\par And live to Christ, and die:
\par To the new Jerusalem
\par He our faithful Guide shall be:
\par Him we claim, and rest in Him,
\par Through all eternity.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

